                        Lunar Conquest Registration

                                   V2.00+

                                  22/10/96

Why Register?

You're missing out on upgrades, setup options, and stuff like that.

What you get.

When you register, you get the latest version of Lunar Conquest, which
includes the latest version of Lunar Conquest and the Lunar Conquest SetUp
program, as well as the full range of support files.

Register Options.

You can:
        send $15 (see below) for the latest version and one (1) free
        upgrade

        send $20 (see below) for the latest inter BBS version and one (1)
        free upgrade.

        send $25 (see below) for the latest version and unlimited
        upgrades

        send $30 (see below) for the latest inter BBS version and one (1)
        free upgrade

Send an international money order for the appropriate amount, in American
currency, with your order form.

As soon as I get your registration form and cash, I'll send off the latest
version of Lunar Conquest in the method of your choice.


